{"id":"d46ee2f661474682","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-book-tm-structure.md","title":"第三版的双向无限带七元组图灵机","display":"df-book-tm-structure — 第三版的双向无限带七元组图灵机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-book-tm-structure","aliases":["73-df-book-tm-structure"],"display":"df-book-tm-structure — 第三版的双向无限带七元组图灵机","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.2, p. 148; scan 156","legacy_source_status":"book-model-reconstructed","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-book-tm-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-book-tm-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-book-tm-structure — 第三版的双向无限带七元组图灵机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2, p. 148; scan 156"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-model-reconstructed"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选七元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R\\)</span> 为方向标签。有限字母表和有类型类缩写见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>；部分函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F\\;[&amp;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land Q\\cap\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F\\;[&amp;M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land Q\\cap\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格区分原书的 (Q,Σ,Γ,δ,q₀,B,F) 与旧目录中 (Q,Σ,Γ,δ,q₀,qacc,qrej) 的七元组接口。第三版允许部分转移，终态是集合 F，带向左右两个方向无限延伸。本定义保留这些结构，配置语义另给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$M$ 为候选七元组，$\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R$ 为方向标签。有限字母表和有类型类缩写见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；部分函数图见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$M$ 为候选七元组，$\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R$ 为方向标签。有限字母表和有类型类缩写见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；部分函数图见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F\\;[&M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\land0<|Q|<\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\\\&\\land Q\\cap\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\land b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\&\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\rightharpoonup Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}].\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}book\\text{-}tm\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2099,"backlinks":[{"id":"0bc309d04895dc6e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,b,F)\\in\\mathsf{BookTM}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-book-tm-structure]]；$w\\in\\Sigma^*$、$i,h,h'\\in\\mathbb Z$。闭包见 [[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。一步关系与停机谓词的配置参数取下述 $\\operatorname{BookConf}_M$；输入占据从零开始的有限区间，两侧均为空白。"},{"id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是旧目录的两终态七元组接口，空白字符作为环境参数；它不等于原书的 (Q,Σ,Γ,δ,q₀,B,F)。原书结构已补在 [[73-df-book-tm-structure]]。此接口插入空白分量后与本地八元组逐步对应；与原书模型的比较须经过另立的模型翻译。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-book-tm-structure|第三版的双向无限带七元组图灵机]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","773cae915e5165f3"]}